+   * sub-method table at 0x91a7 (`902c` -> `906a call *%cs:-0x6e59(%bx)`, bx = byte[di+0x3e]).  The port
+   * had no such function at all, so that entry dispatched into nothing and the unit's steering command
+   * word[di+0x57] was never driven.
